# TEAM-2 · The first task: a cheap worker in its worktree; a message
# mid-turn taken into the turn under way; the sessions resumed after a
# restart (real Claude Code).
start --budget 2
see any key: close
key Escape
key /
type find() in shelf.py should ignore case. Hire one worker on the cheap tier for it; tell it to keep the change small.
key Enter
key Escape Escape
# The worker starts in a worktree of its own (the setup script's ask says so).
allow 240 claude-1
allow 240 ●
# A message while it works: taken into the turn under way, one turn.
key /
type @claude-1 also keep the old tests as they are.
key Enter
key Escape Escape
# Its change comes; its tests ran without asking (record 136).
allow 600 ready to approve || look first
asked-none unittest
sh test -d state/imece/worktrees && ls state/imece/worktrees | grep -q scratch
stop
start --budget 2
see WHERE YOU LEFT OFF
key Escape
key /
type In one sentence: what did claude-1 change?
key Enter
allow 240 lead ⇄ you · 
key Escape Escape
key J
key J
wait 120 goes on in the session it had
